    <Section>Main</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274444</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_260_040_007&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>む、無念……人間ごときに
膝を突かされ、『不燃の古木』も
奪われるとは……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hngh...How pitiful of me... To be
felled by mere mortals, and right
after losing the Unburnable Tree...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274536</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_260_040_008&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>だから、それは
わたしたちじゃないんです</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>We're trying to tell you...it wasn't us!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274632</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_260_040_009&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>この期に及んで
まだそんなことを……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Last time I heard the same lie...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274748</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_260_040_010&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>だから本当だって。
大体、『不燃の古木』って、
それなんなんだよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But it IS true this time! I mean,
we don't even know what the
Unburnable Tree is!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275004</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_260_040_011&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>我が主、焔王の魂から
作られたマテリアル……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It is the material source of my
lord, the Lord of Fire's soul.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275004</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_260_040_012&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>多くの怨念を含み、
手がつけられなくなった
『怒れる大地』</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It is necessary to suppress the
unmanageable excess of negative
emotions in the Land of Ire.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275004</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_260_040_013&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>それを
混沌空間（カオスフィールド）に
封印する折、使われた</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>In essence, it serves as a seal for
this time-space, the Chaos Field.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275104</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_260_040_014&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>その『不燃の古木』が
奪われたらどうなるんです？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Why did they steal this Unburnable Tree?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275216</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_260_040_015&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>『怒れる大地』の封印が解かれ、
この世界は怨嗟に満ちる</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>If the seal in the Land of Ire becomes void,
this entire realm will be overwhelmed by the
deep resentment contained within.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275304</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_260_040_016&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>……もしかして！
仮面の奴らが……！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Those masked guys are probably behind this!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275392</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_260_040_017&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>そうだよ、
たぶん、あの人たち……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>For all we know, yeah. Those two...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275464</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_260_040_018&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>何企んでんだよ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Just...what are they really up to?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275572</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_260_040_019&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>フラムベルクさん！
その『不燃の古木』を
取り戻してきます</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Miss Flamberg, we'll bring
your Unburning Oldwood back!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275832</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_260_040_022&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>でも、あいつら、
どこへ……？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Still...where could they be?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276028</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_260_040_023&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>あれを必要とする者があれば
必ず目的は『怒れる大地』</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>That object's purpose is deeply
connected with the Land of Ire.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276028</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_260_040_024&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>『不燃の古木』を手にする者は
対となる『不凍の流体』も
求めるであろう</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>If they stole the Unburning Oldwood for
that purpose, they will most likely be
after the Unfreezing Fluid next.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276220</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_260_040_026&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>その『不凍の流体』って
どこにあるんですか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Where may we find this Unfreezing Fluid?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>17</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276320</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_260_040_027&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>『不凍の流体』は、
『&lt;Red&gt;氷狼王の礎&lt;White&gt;』に</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>The Unfreezing Fluid lies within
the &lt;Red&gt;Ice Wolf Lord's Cornerstone&lt;White&gt;.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276384</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_260_040_028&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>そこ行こうぜ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Let's go there.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>19</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
